Download And Upload BSR Package To BTS
    [Documentation]
    ...          Performs download of BSR Package from AppServer with provided path, ipv4 address, username,
    ...          password and then uploads this BSR Package to BTS. Address ip, username and password are
    ...          taken from test line configuration i.e. _appserver_siso_ssh = SshServiceDetails(addr="10.42.54.121",
    ...          username="ute", password="oZPS0POrRieRtu"). Object tl of TestLine class in test line configuration
    ...          must contain list of appservers and used AppServer must have index 0.
    ...          Args:
    ...          * remote_path (str) - full path to BSR package on AppServer.
    ...          * bts_type (str) - type of bts, can be GNB or ENB
    ...          * repeat_update_until_successful (bool) - if True, then after failure of BSR package update, it will be repeated
    ...                                                 for 15 minutes every 30 seconds until it succeeds. Default is False.
    [Arguments]                                 ${remote_path}
    ...                                         ${bts_type}=GNB
    ...                                         ${repeat_update_until_successful}=${False}
    ${bsr_package_name}                         vm.get_file_name_from_path
    ...                                         file_path=${remote_path}
    Robot Log Operation                         Setting local path for BSR package
    ${local_path}=                              set variable
    ...                                         /home/ute/${bsr_package_name}
    Robot Log Operation                         Checking if BSR package exists locally
    ${bsr_package_locally}                      vm.is_file_existing
    ...                                         file_path=${local_path}

    Run keyword if                              not ${bsr_package_locally}
    ...                                         Download File From Appserver
    ...                                         remote_path=${remote_path}
    ...                                         local_path=${local_path}
    ...                                         appserver_addr=${tl.appservers[0].iperf_details.ssh_connection_details.addr}
    ...                                         appserver_username=${tl.appservers[0].iperf_details.ssh_connection_details.username}
    ...                                         appserver_password=${tl.appservers[0].iperf_details.ssh_connection_details.password}

    Upload BSR Package To BTS                   path=${local_path}
    ...                                         bts_type=${bts_type}
    ...                                         repeat_update_until_successful=${repeat_update_until_successful}

