Upload BSR Package To BTS
    [Arguments]                                 ${path}
    ...                                         ${timeout}=700
    ...                                         ${reset_time}=20
    ...                                         ${bts_type}=GNB
    ...                                         ${repeat_update_until_successful}=${False}
